Today is Monday morning.
It is raining heavily outside.
I am sitting on the bus to the Infopark office.
I look outside through the window.
The roads are full of water.
The bus goes slowly through the water.
I am remembering my first weeks here.
There was good sunlight in Kochi then.
This bus journey was very new to me then.
I didn't even know where the bus would stop.
But it is not like that now.
I know all these routes exactly.
The bus reaches the stop near the office.
I take my umbrella and get down from the bus.
There is a big puddle on the road in front of me.
But, I know very well where to step now.
I avoid that puddle and walk forward.
This rain and this journey are a part of my life now.
